  "notes": "Two masses of light leaning against each other \u2014 brightest where they still disagree, black where neither reaches. The palette must be two distinguishable hues or the disagreement has nothing to show; a single-hue ramp collapses it to one blob. Sparse and dark: a good hero ground."
